[24.009117, "o", "\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KMEDIUM\u001b[m\u001b[K R3  workload identity tsg-helpdesk has no owner, purpose tag: nobody to call, nothing to review\r\n            why: OWASP NHI1:2025 Improper Offboarding; Entra Agent ID sponsors; AgentCore: consistent tagging\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KMEDIUM\u001b[m\u001b[K R6  role tsg-agent-helpdesk allows 12 h sessions\r\n            why: OWASP NHI7:2025 Long-Lived Secrets\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KMEDIUM\u001b[m\u001b[K R6  launcher asks for 12 h role sessions\r\n            why: OWASP NHI7:2025 Long-Lived Secrets\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KMEDIUM\u001b[m\u001b[K R9  CloudTrail doesn't log AWS::BedrockAgentCore::WorkloadIdentity data events (off by default)\r\n            why: CloudTrail: data events are not logged by default\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KMEDIUM\u001b[m\u001b[K R9  CloudTrail doesn't log AWS::BedrockAgentCore::TokenVault data events (off by default)\r\n            why: CloudTrail: data events are not logged by default\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[K--\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n6 HIGH, 5 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KMEDIUM\u001b[m\u001b[K, 0 LOW  (11 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[Kfindings\u001b[m\u001b[K)\r\n"]
