[78.056843, "o", "\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KQ2\u001b[m\u001b[K agent calls with no human on the session:\r\n   2027-01-21T09:15:02Z  tsg-agent-helpdesk       helpdesk-0915    GetWorkloadAccessTokenForJWT\r\n   2027-01-21T09:15:04Z  tsg-agent-helpdesk       helpdesk-0915    GetResourceOauth2Token\r\n   2027-01-21T09:15:07Z  tsg-agent-helpdesk       helpdesk-0915b   GetWorkloadAccessTokenForJWT\r\n   2027-01-21T09:15:09Z  tsg-agent-helpdesk       helpdesk-0915b   GetResourceOauth2Token\r\nQ3 runs whose session names a different human than the validated JWT:\r\n   tickets-run-0925     tickets  JWT user u-1002-bob     session says user-u-1001-alice\r\nQ4 workload identities shared by more than one agent:\r\n   tsg-helpdesk: used by the mail and tickets agents\r\n"]
