[91.200107, "o", "The launcher's own log row for run tickets-run-0925 (aws/data/app-log.jsonl, 8 rows)\r\n\r\n   ts               2027-01-21T09:25:00Z           when the launcher started the run\r\n   agent            tickets                        which agent it started\r\n   jwt_iss          Cognito user pool (example)    who signed the user's sign-in token\r\n   jwt_sub          u-1002-bob                     the user in the token the launcher VALIDATED\r\n   source_identity  user-u-1001-alice              the name it stamped on the role session\r\n\r\n   token user and session name DO NOT match. CloudTrail only sees the second one.\r\n"]
